WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.160 --> 00:00:05.040
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie and this week
for my bonus Arrow video I’m going to breakdown

00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:08.100
the Justice League movie that they just announced
with Zack Snyder.

00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:11.292
So we’ll start with all the confirmed stuff
first and then all the characters and stories

00:00:11.292 --> 00:00:13.389
I think they should do.

00:00:13.389 --> 00:00:16.040
I know a lot of you have been asking me about
how TV Shows like Arrow and Stephen Amell

00:00:16.040 --> 00:00:18.820
are going to be involved so I’ll talk about
that too.

00:00:18.820 --> 00:00:21.570
If you’re finding me for the first time
every week I’m doing a bonus Arrow video

00:00:21.570 --> 00:00:23.029
counting down to episode 23 the finale.

00:00:23.029 --> 00:00:24.740
That’s in two weeks.

00:00:24.740 --> 00:00:27.460
There’s only two more episodes.

00:00:27.460 --> 00:00:36.910
So be sure to subscribe to get everything
and leave me suggestions for for those other

00:00:36.910 --> 00:00:38.750
bonus vids.

00:00:38.750 --> 00:00:47.399
So first thing, Warner Brothers confirmed
Zack Snyder will direct Justice League and

00:00:47.399 --> 00:00:50.980
that it will shoot back to back with Superman
VS Batman.

00:00:50.980 --> 00:00:55.360
So it’s possible if they get the script
done quickly enough, they could hit a 2017

00:00:55.360 --> 00:00:56.360
release date.

00:00:56.360 --> 00:00:58.829
But plan for spring 2018.

00:00:58.829 --> 00:01:02.329
The haven’t announced who will be writing
it, but I would assume that several people

00:01:02.329 --> 00:01:04.960
will be involved.

00:01:04.960 --> 00:01:09.290
Christopher Nolan has kind of moved on from
DC Movies, he wasn’t really involved at

00:01:09.290 --> 00:01:11.260
all with the Superman VS Batman script.

00:01:11.260 --> 00:01:14.000
That was all David S. Goyer and Zack Snyder.

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:17.480
They’ll definitely be part of the writing
team for Justice League, but because casting

00:01:17.480 --> 00:01:19.090
Ben Affleck was such a big deal.

00:01:19.090 --> 00:01:24.300
I wouldn’t be surprised if he has script
approval and Warner Brothers lets him take

00:01:24.300 --> 00:01:26.000
a pass at the story.

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:29.970
Christopher Nolan could always be helicoptered
in for any emergencies too.

00:01:29.970 --> 00:01:33.990
Justice League is a huge risk for them, so
they’ll spare no expense in making sure

00:01:33.990 --> 00:01:36.400
it makes billions of dollars.

00:01:36.400 --> 00:01:42.130
Now let’s talk about cast, the holy trinity
will of course be back as will all the secondary

00:01:42.130 --> 00:01:51.060
characters they’ve announced recently for
Superman VS Batman including Jesse Eisenberg

00:01:51.060 --> 00:01:56.220
as Lex Luthor, Jeremy Irons as Alfred and
Ray Fisher as Cyborg.

00:01:56.220 --> 00:02:00.970
But what about all the other Justice League
members that are already on TV, like Stephen

00:02:00.970 --> 00:02:01.970
Amell and Grant Gustin?

00:02:01.970 --> 00:02:02.970
Green Arrow and The Flash are core team members.

00:02:02.970 --> 00:02:04.600
And I know a lot of you want them to be in
the movie.

00:02:04.600 --> 00:02:08.920
Here’s the reality, because Zack Snyder
is doing Justice League, it implies that the

00:02:08.920 --> 00:02:12.360
tone of the movie will be consistent with
his Man of Steel movies.

00:02:12.360 --> 00:02:16.260
So the story will flow with the same energy
and visually the world will look the same.

00:02:16.260 --> 00:02:26.160
There will just be more characters and a more
complex story.

00:02:26.160 --> 00:02:31.140
Superman VS Batman started filming in February
and that will take about six months to finish.

00:02:31.140 --> 00:02:34.230
So if Justice League will film back to back
it means this fall they’ll start shooting

00:02:34.230 --> 00:02:39.310
it in the fall right in the middle of Arrow
Season 3 and The Flash Season 1.

00:02:39.310 --> 00:02:42.420
Which is bad news for anyone that wants to
see Stephen Amell and Grant Gustin in the

00:02:42.420 --> 00:02:43.420
movie.

00:02:43.420 --> 00:02:45.690
That doesn’t me they won’t be in it.

00:02:45.690 --> 00:02:48.540
It just means there’s zero chance they’ll
have major roles.

00:02:48.540 --> 00:02:52.950
They could always have a two second cameo
just wearing plain clothes.

00:02:52.950 --> 00:02:58.450
And they could always be name-dropped by the
other characters.

00:02:58.450 --> 00:03:01.340
Warner Brothers won’t ever say “no they’re
not going to be in it.”

00:03:01.340 --> 00:03:07.090
Never say never, but just looking at those
shooting schedules.

00:03:07.090 --> 00:03:15.910
I’m pretty sure they’re not going to be
in it.

00:03:15.910 --> 00:03:17.350
What about other characters though.

00:03:17.350 --> 00:03:19.569
There’s tons of Justice League characters.

00:03:19.569 --> 00:03:26.280
Here’s my Top 5 I think should get cameos:

00:03:26.280 --> 00:03:27.910
Number 5 - Zatanna

00:03:27.910 --> 00:03:31.530
They haven’t established magic in the Man
of Steel Universe, so they’d have to bend

00:03:31.530 --> 00:03:33.360
some of the logic on her powers.

00:03:33.360 --> 00:03:35.680
But they have to include some more girl power
on the team.

00:03:35.680 --> 00:03:40.020
A lot of people got upset at JJ Abrams and
Disney when it seemed like the new Star Wars

00:03:40.020 --> 00:03:42.890
trilogy would be a total boys club.

00:03:42.890 --> 00:03:44.080
Number 4 - Aquaman

00:03:44.080 --> 00:03:48.709
Again, they’d have to get a little timey
wimey with his backstory and powers.

00:03:48.709 --> 00:03:52.610
How could Superman have those amazing senses
and not know about a race of highly advanced

00:03:52.610 --> 00:03:54.610
Atlanteans living in the ocean.

00:03:54.610 --> 00:03:58.780
But Aquaman could always cameo as a normal
person, not in costume.

00:03:58.780 --> 00:04:01.840
Like Oliver Queen getting a cameo, not The
Arrow.

00:04:01.840 --> 00:04:04.090
Number 3 - Shazam

00:04:04.090 --> 00:04:08.720
Again, another magic user so they’d have
to establish a credible explanation for his

00:04:08.720 --> 00:04:09.720
powers.

00:04:09.720 --> 00:04:11.770
Or he could just be Billy Batson in the movie.

00:04:11.770 --> 00:04:16.430
But right now Dwayne Johnson is developing
a project with DC and Warner Brothers and

00:04:16.430 --> 00:04:19.820
it’s supposed to be Shazam.

00:04:19.820 --> 00:04:21.260
Number 2 - Supergirl

00:04:21.260 --> 00:04:25.240
Again, I think it would be fun for a Kara
cameo.

00:04:25.240 --> 00:04:27.130
Not a full on suit-wearing Supergirl.

00:04:27.130 --> 00:04:31.290
It’s just another interesting way of deepening
the new Man of Steel mythology they created

00:04:31.290 --> 00:04:33.710
with the first movie.

00:04:33.710 --> 00:04:37.320
and my number 1 new character - Martian Manhunter

00:04:37.320 --> 00:04:41.910
We’ll need Oreos, lots and lots of Oreos.

00:04:41.910 --> 00:04:44.070
Even if they don’t include him officially.

00:04:44.070 --> 00:04:51.580
It would be so awesome if they added easter
eggs for him in the form of cookies.

00:04:51.580 --> 00:04:56.880
In reality, they probably already have all
the characters they want and when you look

00:04:56.880 --> 00:05:01.540
at Superman VS Batman on paper, it kind of
is a World’s Finest version of Justice League

00:05:01.540 --> 00:05:02.540
anyway.

00:05:02.540 --> 00:05:09.570
So just expect the story of that movie to
tie directly into the events of Justice League.

00:05:09.570 --> 00:05:14.380
The rumors right now are that Batman is going
to hate the crap out of Superman for most

00:05:14.380 --> 00:05:16.400
of the movie.

00:05:16.400 --> 00:05:18.900
No idea on how Wonder Woman is going to enter
the story.

00:05:18.900 --> 00:05:23.130
But the Justice League won’t form until
all the characters unite in common cause against

00:05:23.130 --> 00:05:26.389
Lex Luthor and whatever other villains they
use.

00:05:26.389 --> 00:05:27.410
So now it’s your turn.

00:05:27.410 --> 00:05:32.389
Let me know which characters you’d like
to see in Justice League and what kind of

00:05:32.389 --> 00:05:35.070
a story you’d like them to do.

